@Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5107

### 发布消息：第 1 次处理失败，重试后第 2 次成功
POST {{Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "payload": "hello",
  "failUntilAttempt": 1
}

### 发布毒消息：每次都失败，3 次尝试（含首次）后进死信队列
POST {{Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "payload": "poison",
  "failUntilAttempt": 99
}

### 查看队列快照（readyOrProcessing / succeeded 与最大尝试次数说明）
GET {{Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/queue
Accept: application/json

### 查看死信队列
GET {{Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dlq
Accept: application/json

### payload 为空（返回 400）
POST {{Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "payload": ""
}

###
GET {{Demo.MqConsumer.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
